#QLCIR-G1
# name: demorgan_channels_k2_d3_rev
# family: physics/complemented-channels
# expected: UNSAT
# physical: Logical relation between a coarse detector event and the event that none of its constituent channels occurs.
# note: One-sided difference test for De Morgan equivalence between exclusion of a 2-channel coarse event and simultaneous exclusion of every channel.
dim(3)
output(7)
1 = or(ch0, ch1)
2 = not(1)
3 = not(ch0)
4 = not(ch1)
5 = and(3, 4)
6 = not(2)
7 = and(5, 6)
